          <draw minH="4.2mm" name="C4" w="181mm"><ui><textEdit/></ui><value><text>Bill of Lading/Air Way Bill Number, Commercial Invoice, Packing List, Manufacturer Certificate, CCVO (Combined Certificate for Value &amp; Origin), ECTN (Electronic Cargo Tracking Note) are mandatory documents as shipping advice to buyer and our Clearing/Logistic Department.</text></value><font size="9pt" typeface="Arial"/><margin bottomInset="0.51mm" leftInset="0.353mm" rightInset="0.8mm" topInset="0.3mm"/><para hAlign="left" lineHeight="3.39mm" textIndent="0.353mm" vAlign="top"/><border><edge presence="hidden"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge presence="hidden"/><edge presence="hidden"/></border></draw>
